      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Color Converter</title>\n  <style>\n    [hidden] {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      color: #1e293b;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;\n    }\n\n    .converter-card {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 440px;\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n      padding: 2rem;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 1.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .header {\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .header h1 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #0f172a;\n      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n    }\n\n    .header p {\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      color: #64748b;\n    }\n\n    .swatch-container {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.75rem;\n    }\n\n    .swatch {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 120px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      border: 3px solid #e2e8f0;\n      background-color: #000000;\n      transition: background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;\n      box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n    }\n\n    .hex-display {\n      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      color: #0f172a;\n      min-height: 2rem;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .hex-display.error {\n      color: #dc2626;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .inputs-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 0.75rem;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 380px) {\n      .inputs-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n    }\n\n    .input-group {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 0.35rem;\n    }\n\n    .input-group label {\n      font-size: 0.875rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #475569;\n    }\n\n    .input-group input {\n      width: 100%;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;\n      border: 2px solid #cbd5e1;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      background-color: #f8fafc;\n      color: #0f172a;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, background-color 0.2s;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .input-group input:hover {\n      border-color: #94a3b8;\n    }\n\n    .input-group input:focus {\n      border-color: #3b82f6;\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);\n    }\n\n    .input-group input.invalid {\n      border-color: #ef4444;\n      background-color: #fef2f2;\n    }\n\n    .input-group input.invalid:focus {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);\n    }\n\n    .message-banner {\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      background-color: #fee2e2;\n      color: #991b1b;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"converter-card\">\n    <header class=\"header\">\n      <h1>Pixel Color Converter</h1>\n      <p>Enter RGB values between 0 and 255</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"swatch-container\" aria-label=\"Color preview\">\n      <div id=\"colorSwatch\" class=\"swatch\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Color preview swatch\"></div>\n      <div id=\"hexCode\" class=\"hex-display\" aria-live=\"polite\">#000000</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div id=\"errorBanner\" class=\"message-banner\" role=\"alert\" hidden>Invalid value</div>\n\n    <form id=\"colorForm\" onsubmit=\"return false;\">\n      <div class=\"inputs-grid\">\n        <div class=\"input-group\">\n          <label for=\"redInput\">Red (R)</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            id=\"redInput\"\n            name=\"red\"\n            min=\"0\"\n            max=\"255\"\n            value=\"0\"\n            step=\"1\"\n            aria-describedby=\"errorBanner\"\n            required\n          >\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"input-group\">\n          <label for=\"greenInput\">Green (G)</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            id=\"greenInput\"\n            name=\"green\"\n            min=\"0\"\n            max=\"255\"\n            value=\"0\"\n            step=\"1\"\n            aria-describedby=\"errorBanner\"\n            required\n          >\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"input-group\">\n          <label for=\"blueInput\">Blue (B)</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            id=\"blueInput\"\n            name=\"blue\"\n            min=\"0\"\n            max=\"255\"\n            value=\"0\"\n            step=\"1\"\n            aria-describedby=\"errorBanner\"\n            required\n          >\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    const redInput = document.getElementById('redInput');\n    const greenInput = document.getElementById('greenInput');\n    const blueInput = document.getElementById('blueInput');\n    const hexCode = document.getElementById('hexCode');\n    const colorSwatch = document.getElementById('colorSwatch');\n    const errorBanner = document.getElementById('errorBanner');\n\n    function isValidChannel(valueStr) {\n      if (valueStr.trim() === '') return false;\n      const num = Number(valueStr);\n      return Number.isInteger(num) && num >= 0 && num <= 255;\n    }\n\n    function toHex(val) {\n      return Number(val).toString(16).padStart(2, '0').toUpperCase();\n    }\n\n    function updateConverter() {\n      const rVal = redInput.value;\n      const gVal = greenInput.value;\n      const bVal = blueInput.value;\n\n      const rValid = isValidChannel(rVal);\n      const gValid = isValidChannel(gVal);\n      const bValid = isValidChannel(bVal);\n\n      redInput.classList.toggle('invalid', !rValid);\n      greenInput.classList.toggle('invalid', !gValid);\n      blueInput.classList.toggle('invalid', !bValid);\n\n      if (rValid && gValid && bValid) {\n        const hex = '#' + toHex(rVal) + toHex(gVal) + toHex(bVal);\n        hexCode.textContent = hex;\n        hexCode.classList.remove('error');\n        colorSwatch.style.backgroundColor = hex;\n        colorSwatch.style.borderColor = '#e2e8f0';\n        errorBanner.hidden = true;\n      } else {\n        hexCode.textContent = 'Invalid value';\n        hexCode.classList.add('error');\n        colorSwatch.style.backgroundColor = '#e2e8f0';\n        colorSwatch.style.borderColor = '#ef4444';\n        errorBanner.hidden = false;\n      }\n    }\n\n    [redInput, greenInput, blueInput].forEach(function(input) {\n      input.addEventListener('input', updateConverter);\n      input.addEventListener('change', updateConverter);\n    });\n\n    updateConverter();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": "Main HTML file containing the semantic markup, accessible labeled inputs, color swatch preview, and embedded CSS and JavaScript."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Color Converter\n\nA responsive, offline browser application for live RGB to HEX color conversion with immediate visual feedback.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Live Conversion**: Converts Red, Green, and Blue values (0–255) to uppercase 6-digit HEX codes (e.g., `#FF8800`) instantly upon typing or stepper interaction.\n- **Real-Time Swatch**: Visual preview swatch updates in real time to match the input color.\n- **Input Validation**: Displays `Invalid value` whenever any value is left empty, non-integer, or outside the range of 0 to 255.\n- **Accessibility**: Semantic HTML form elements, explicit label associations, live region announcements (`aria-live`), and clear keyboard focus indicators.\n- **Responsive UI**: Adaptive centered card layout designed for mobile devices (down to 360px) and desktop screens.\n- **Zero Dependencies**: Pure HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript without external libraries or network requests.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` directly in any modern web browser.\n2. Enter integer values between `0` and `255` into the **Red**, **Green**, and **Blue** fields.\n3. Observe the HEX string and color swatch preview update live.\n",
      "description": "Documentation for the Pixel Color Converter project outlining features, usage, and structure."
    }
  ]
